sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant G as Candidate generator
  participant F as Feature store
  participant R as Ranker
  participant L as Feedback log
  U->>G: Event
  G->>F: Request features
  F-->>G: User and item vectors
  G->>R: Candidates
  R-->>U: Ranked feed
  U->>L: Clicks and purchases
  L-->>G: Fresh training data
